    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/fe38d943d23d816f939a3684777730e2.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=115 /></span>Feel free to check out the demo of the game, which is available here on Steam! Share your thoughts and feedback on the Discord server, or in the Steam Community Hub!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/f77723c0ebc1a1a61e14d409ae495a55.poster.avif?t=1749476319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/f77723c0ebc1a1a61e14d409ae495a55.webm?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/f77723c0ebc1a1a61e14d409ae495a55.mp4?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>The Vanished Soul</strong> is a first-person, psychological horror game developed entirely by one person. Set in 2016 in the fictional town of Novazenica, it weaves subtle references to Bosnia and Herzegovina into a haunting narrative. As the story unfolds, you'll uncover dark secrets through <strong>meaningful choices</strong>, <strong>dynamic scares</strong>, and <strong>layered environmental storytelling</strong>. Explore a detailed, atmospheric world, solve immersive puzzles, and interact with objects that breathe life into the environment and deepen the mystery.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/f7e291f9c05ad716579e793214273869.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't rely heavily on grotesque and gore elements but instead tries to slowly bring discomfort to the players through lighting, sounds, and effects. Combine that with the story elements, and you will have a realistic and atmospheric experience in this horror game. The Vanished Soul is powered by Unreal Engine 5, which brings some of the latest technologies, like real-time global illumination, helping you immerse yourself in the game as much as possible!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/aae3d6b69c19ddbcc6981af971f21561.poster.avif?t=1749476319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/aae3d6b69c19ddbcc6981af971f21561.webm?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/aae3d6b69c19ddbcc6981af971f21561.mp4?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/f7b1176f3aec2654a2ee881a2889cf49.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=110 /></span>Step into the shoes of the main protagonist as you uncover the disturbing mysteries hidden in the fictional town of Novazenica and its haunting surroundings. The Vanished Soul weaves a personal and emotional narrative that explores themes of memory, guilt, and connection with loved ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices matter. Dialogue options, actions, and the paths you take can influence how the story unfolds, revealing different perspectives, outcomes, and consequences.</strong> As you explore, you\u2019ll uncover fragments of the past scattered throughout the world, slowly piecing together what really happened. It's up to you to decide how much of the truth you\u2019re ready to face.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/ae8af35e1b709c26bce47f06a4178c6e.poster.avif?t=1749476319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/ae8af35e1b709c26bce47f06a4178c6e.webm?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/ae8af35e1b709c26bce47f06a4178c6e.mp4?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/a98dfd3338ecaaf16928381052336560.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=115 /></span>Interact with many objects in the game, either to solve a puzzle, just for fun, or maybe to hit someone. It is up to you to discover all the ways to use the objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/e45615937d2dd04b0f3a039c5937ea30.poster.avif?t=1749476319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/e45615937d2dd04b0f3a039c5937ea30.webm?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/e45615937d2dd04b0f3a039c5937ea30.mp4?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/07e7cb765c941ef32b5fd5d26d8a7078.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=115 /></span>Solve the various puzzles you encounter throughout the game to progress further. You will either need to find evidence or clues in specific areas, or you might need to use logic to reach the final solution. The game will try to vary the puzzles, or, to be more precise, the way you solve them, and every puzzle will bring a different challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/84d4d0138094e79007f1417d52af28f7.poster.avif?t=1749476319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/84d4d0138094e79007f1417d52af28f7.webm?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/84d4d0138094e79007f1417d52af28f7.mp4?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/8472c19d646a3445079f2b56403b4b99.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=115 /></span>The game features a <strong>Dynamic Scare System</strong>, which ensures that no two playthroughs are the same when it comes to terrifying moments. Jump scares are randomized, selected from multiple predefined spots throughout the game. This system keeps players on edge, avoiding predictable scares and guaranteeing a unique, spine chilling experience every time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/c032e406b27b52c622a9006bd18b33fe.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=115 /></span>If you are interested in the game, and would like to stay up to date, please consider to add the game to your wishlist! Also, feel free to join the Discord community which is linked on the page, and visible on top of this page. And last, but not least, feel free to share your thoughts in the Steam Community as well!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/fe38d943d23d816f939a3684777730e2.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=115 /></span>Feel free to check out the demo of the game, which is available here on Steam! Share your thoughts and feedback on the Discord server, or in the Steam Community Hub!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/f77723c0ebc1a1a61e14d409ae495a55.poster.avif?t=1749476319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/f77723c0ebc1a1a61e14d409ae495a55.webm?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/f77723c0ebc1a1a61e14d409ae495a55.mp4?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>The Vanished Soul</strong> is a first-person, psychological horror game developed entirely by one person. Set in 2016 in the fictional town of Novazenica, it weaves subtle references to Bosnia and Herzegovina into a haunting narrative. As the story unfolds, you'll uncover dark secrets through <strong>meaningful choices</strong>, <strong>dynamic scares</strong>, and <strong>layered environmental storytelling</strong>. Explore a detailed, atmospheric world, solve immersive puzzles, and interact with objects that breathe life into the environment and deepen the mystery.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/f7e291f9c05ad716579e793214273869.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn