of the truth you\u2019re ready to face.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/ae8af35e1b709c26bce47f06a4178c6e.poster.avif?t=1749476319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/ae8af35e1b709c26bce47f06a4178c6e.webm?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/ae8af35e1b709c26bce47f06a4178c6e.mp4?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/a98dfd3338ecaaf16928381052336560.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=115 /></span>Interact with many objects in the game, either to solve a puzzle, just for fun, or maybe to hit someone. It is up to you to discover all the ways to use the objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/e45615937d2dd04b0f3a039c5937ea30.poster.avif?t=1749476319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/e45615937d2dd04b0f3a039c5937ea30.webm?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/e45615937d2dd04b0f3a039c5937ea30.mp4?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/07e7cb765c941ef32b5fd5d26d8a7078.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=115 /></span>Solve the various puzzles you encounter throughout the game to progress further. You will either need to find evidence or clues in specific areas, or you might need to use logic to reach the final solution. The game will try to vary the puzzles, or, to be more precise, the way you solve them, and every puzzle will bring a different challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/84d4d0138094e79007f1417d52af28f7.poster.avif?t=1749476319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/84d4d0138094e79007f1417d52af28f7.webm?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/84d4d0138094e79007f1417d52af28f7.mp4?t=1749476319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/8472c19d646a3445079f2b56403b4b99.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=115 /></span>The game features a <strong>Dynamic Scare System</strong>, which ensures that no two playthroughs are the same when it comes to terrifying moments. Jump scares are randomized, selected from multiple predefined spots throughout the game. This system keeps players on edge, avoiding predictable scares and guaranteeing a unique, spine chilling experience every time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126900/extras/c032e406b27b52c622a9006bd18b33fe.avif?t=1749476319\" width=800 height=115 /></span>If you are interested in the game, and would like to stay up to date, please consider to add the game to your wishlist! Also, feel free to join the Discord community which is linked on the page, and visible on top of this page. And last, but not least, feel free to share your thoughts in the Steam Community as well!</p>",
